# Title: Insecure Transfer Via Curl.EXE
# ID: cb9cc1d1-e84e-4bdc-b7ad-c31b1b7908ec
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: X__Junior (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-06-30
# Tags: attack.execution
# Description: Detects execution of "curl.exe" with the "--insecure" flag.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((process.command_line:/\s-k\s/) OR (process.command_line:*--insecure*)) AND ((process.executable:*\\curl.exe) OR (process.pe.original_file_name:"curl.exe")))
